# B_long = synthetic 256- and 768-token prompts, exactly 96 new tokens (no EOS stop).
# "equal x/y" = number of prompts whose output tokens are identical to ordinary cached greedy decoding.
# Peak = torch max_memory_allocated (includes model weights).

